way and the rest is backordered. The selling price is $2138.184 per unit, and Schneider Electric pays exactly 29.0 days after delivery. The network itself is straightforward: Process Go. sends solder_paste to the Fab, PrecisionParts sends memory_chip to the Fab, and the Fab forwards FPGA output to the Logistics Center. The model is run over 365 weeks, with results collected after a 30-week warm-up period.

