uctors also buys SoC, with orders arriving every 34.0 to 37.0 days and volumes between 2041722.0 units and 2957361.0 units; its shipments take 5.0 days, available stock is shipped immediately with the remainder backordered, the sales price is $170.348 per unit, and customer payment comes 33.0 days after delivery. The model runs for 200 days, with results collected after a 50 day warm-up period, using 1 replication.

